{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">股評人連敬涵於節目中推介聯想集團(992)，指公司整體業績爆發，AI價值持續兌現之外，其他業務亦全面向好，反映海外增長強勁，認為聯想具備中線投資價值。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">連敬涵指股價在業績後見頂並回落數天，建議在29元才部署買入，目標價上望37元，若失守24元便止蝕。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"4323.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026pyHnbQyxkB1787209349.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"4323.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">聯想集團(992)</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">股評人買賣策略</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">買入：$29</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">目標：$37</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">止蝕：$24</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"4324.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026gO8c9E6k371787209382.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"4324.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">股評人趙晞文推介安踏體育(2020)，指多品牌策略支撐公司業績，其中有持股的Amer Sports盈利增長以倍數計，預料安踏業績會繼續跑贏同業，而且現水平估值吸引。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"4325.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026r5n4v5U8oU1787209404.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"4325.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">趙晞文建議73元吸納，目標價看81元，止蝕價定於65元。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">安踏體育(2020)</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">股評人買賣策略</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">買入：$73</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">目標：$81</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">止蝕：$65</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"4326.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026iVRoaC6tY81787209431.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"4326.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-20T07:19:04.023436+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":316,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}